### ENS licenses and keys ###
# Licenses are per deployment and private keys are never committed. The exceptions are the ENS portal's
# fixtures, signed with its published TEST key, which only the tests trust.
*.lic
!src/test/resources/ens-license-fixtures/*.lic
*private.pem
# Copied into the license volume by the compose files (see Licensing in the README).
/license/

### Release bundles (scripts/release-bundle.sh) ###
/dist/
